    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Model and manage your data with OpenRegister]]></title>
        <id>https://www.conduction.nl/nl/academy/model-data-with-openregister/</id>
        <link href="https://www.conduction.nl/nl/academy/model-data-with-openregister/"/>
        <updated>2026-06-28T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[OpenRegister is the data engine behind every Conduction app. It stores your data not as rows in a hand-built table but as objects that follow a schema you design, grouped into a register you own. Where a traditional application bakes its data model into code and a database migration, OpenRegister lets you draw the model in the interface and start storing real records the same minute, with versioning, an audit trail, search, files and permissions all handled for you.]]></summary>
        <author>
            <name>Conduction</name>
            <uri>https://conduction.nl</uri>
        </author>
